p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The realm is full of colorful characters and things to do. Take a couple of days off and explore to discover all that the realm has to offer \u2013 you are sure to find something useful for your tavern on your journeys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139980/extras/95d768c08ab8fcdeeb65c0004a1f766f.poster.avif?t=1753093963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139980/extras/95d768c08ab8fcdeeb65c0004a1f766f.webm?t=1753093963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139980/extras/95d768c08ab8fcdeeb65c0004a1f766f.mp4?t=1753093963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play with your friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun playing online in games of up to 4 players! Team up with your friends to explore the world, or set them to work at your tavern! (And you won't have to pay them any gold for it!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139980/extras/14a4e9c642da02224a3fa0c04bf1cb16.poster.avif?t=1753093963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139980/extras/14a4e9c642da02224a3fa0c04bf1cb16.webm?t=1753093963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139980/extras/14a4e9c642da02224a3fa0c04bf1cb16.mp4?t=1753093963\" type=\"video/m